# Why Does This Work?

Suppose

```text
a ≥ b ≥ c ≥ d
```

Then

```text
(a-1) ≥ (b-1) ≥ (c-1) ≥ (d-1)
```

Since all values are non-negative (`nums[i] >= 1`), multiplying the two largest adjusted values always gives the maximum product. Thus, choosing the two largest numbers is optimal.

